<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Federated Stores started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Federated Stores started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Brown Brothers analyst Joe Ronning said he started coverage of Federated Department Stores with a short-term hold and set a 1997 share earnings estimate of $2.50.</p>
<p>-- The stock slipped 3/8 to 33-3/8.</p>
</text>
